  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/01AQ">Definition <span data-tag="01AQ">17.4.5</span>.</a> Let $(X, \mathcal{O}_ X)$ be a ringed space. Let $\mathcal{F}$ be a sheaf of $\mathcal{O}_ X$-modules. Given a set $I$, and local sections $s_ i$, $i \in I$ of $\mathcal{F}$ we say that the subsheaf $\mathcal{G}$ of Lemma <a href="/tag/01AP" data-tag="01AP">17.4.4</a> above is the <em>subsheaf generated by the $s_ i$</em>. </p>
